{"ref":"BDB, עָוַת","hw":"עָוַת","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עָוַת</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be bent, crooked (</strong>NH id., Pi. Nithp.; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">עַוֵּית</span> Pa.; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܥܰܬ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܥܬܳܐ</span> <em>deceive</em> PS <sup>3008</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִוְּתָ֑נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:6\" href=\"/Job.19.6\">Jb 19:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עִוְּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:13\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.13\">Ec 7:13</a>; 3 pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִוְּתוּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:78\" href=\"/Psalms.119.78\">ψ 119:78</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְעַוֵּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 146:9\" href=\"/Psalms.146.9\">ψ 146:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 8:3\" href=\"/Job.8.3\">Jb 8:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְעַוֶּת־</span> v <a data-ref=\"Job 8:3\" href=\"/Job.8.3\">3</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְעַוֵּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:5\" href=\"/Amos.8.5\">Am 8:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:36\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.36\">La 3:36</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <strong> a.</strong> <em>make crooked</em> = falsify, scales <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:5\" href=\"/Amos.8.5\">Am 8:5</a>; <em>pervert</em> justice (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁפָּט</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶדֶק</span>) <a data-ref=\"Job 8:3\" href=\"/Job.8.3\">Jb 8:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:12\" href=\"/Job.34.12\">34:12</a> (all God subj.); c. acc. pers. <em>subvert</em> (i.e. deprive of justice), <span dir=\"rtl\">לְע׳ אָדָם בְּרִיבוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:36\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.36\">La 3:36</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:78\" href=\"/Psalms.119.78\">ψ 119:78</a> (v.l. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:61\" href=\"/Psalms.119.61\">119:61</a>); so <span dir=\"rtl\">עִוְּתָנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:6\" href=\"/Job.19.6\">Jb 19:6</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj.). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>bend, make crooked</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ רְשָׁעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 146:9\" href=\"/Psalms.146.9\">ψ 146:9</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj.); in gen. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:13\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.13\">Ec 7:13</a> (God subj.; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּקֵּן</span>).<br><strong>Pu.</strong>  Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעֻוָּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 1:15\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.1.15\">Ec 1:15</a> <em>what is bent</em> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּקֹן</span>).<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  Pf. 3 pl. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִתְעַוְּתוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:3\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.3\">Ec 12:3</a> <em>and</em> the strong men <em>bend themselves</em>.","next":"BDB, עַוָּתָה","prev":"BDB, יְעוּשׁ²"}